# Cached Python downloads (large binaries). Both builds bundle the interpreter
# pinned in python_release.env, which IS tracked; these are the copies of it.
mac/.python_cache/
windows/.python_cache/

# The interpreter tree build_installer.bat extracts for Inno Setup to ship (issue #261)
windows/python/

# Build artifacts
mac/staging/
mac/*.dmg
windows/output/

# The version installer.iss compiles with, generated from config/constants.py's
# APP_VERSION before every Windows build (issue #260). Committed, it would be a second
# place the version is written - and, being generated, the one nobody would think to
# update. Here rather than in the repo-root .gitignore because this file is already
# where every other build product of these two scripts is ignored.
windows/version.iss
